{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_81_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_81","textTraditional":"一、十有八年，春王正月，宋公會曹伯、衞人、邾婁人伐齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_81_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_81","textTraditional":"二、夏，師救齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_81_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_81","textTraditional":"三、五月戊寅，宋師及齊師戰于甗，齊師敗績。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_81_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_81","textTraditional":"戰不言伐，此其言伐何？宋公與伐而不與戰，故言伐。春秋伐者為客，伐者為主。曷為不使齊主之？與襄公之征齊也。曷為與襄公之征齊？桓公死，豎刁、易牙爭權不葬，為是故伐之也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_81_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_81","textTraditional":"四、狄救齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_81_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_81","textTraditional":"五、秋八月丁亥，葬齊桓公。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_81_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_81","textTraditional":"六、冬，邢人、狄人伐衞。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}